# Env file for ppat/validate-kubernetes-manifests' post-build `flux envsubst` step (see
# .github/workflows/lint.yaml's kubernetes-manifests job). Intentionally empty: none of the
# ClusterPolicy/ClusterCleanupPolicy manifests in this repo use Flux postBuild `${VAR}`
# substitution (they're standalone Kyverno policies, not Flux-substituted app manifests), so
# there is nothing to define here yet. Kept wired up (rather than dropping --env-file from the
# job) so a future policy that does need a substituted value only has to add it here.
